    "text": "By Editorial ,\n32 minutes ago Today is Thursday, Dec. 25, the 359th day of 2025. There are six days left in the year. This is Christmas Day. On Dec. 25, 1776, Gen. George Washington and his troops crossed the Delaware River for a surprise attack against Hessian forces at Trenton, New Jersey, during the American Revolutionary War. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
